  first | exact @GlobalTheory.MomOne.FormalMul.padic_multiplications | exact GlobalTheory.MomOne.FormalMul.padic_multiplications | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.MomOne.FormalMul.padic_multiplications <;> assumption)
